  "description": "HPC is proud to introduce the BEST value high performance enduro bike! High quality components, hand-built wheels and an INSANELY powerful motor system will make sure this is the best ride yet.\n\nThis full carbon trail bike is our first all new full suspension bike in 3 years, and we are beyond excited to share this bike with you. During frame development, we worked with DVO Suspension to refine kinematics and maximize suspension performance with full custom factory tunes on both the front fork and rear shock. This is a true lightweight, high performance machine that will please the serious trail rider to the mild mannered adventure seeker. People have been asking for a bike like this from us for a long time, and we are proud to finally deliver after 2 years of development and testing.\n\nImagine having a bike with up to 2X the power and torque of any of the mainstream big box brands, a massive 780wh 52V USA made battery pack built into the frame that provides up to 45 miles of range, and an incredibly plush 160mm of factory tuned suspension travel. Well, dream no more, the wait is finally over!\n\nNot only does this bike have torque sensing pedal assist, but is extremely unique in its ability to use a thumb throttle as well to take over power delivery on demand. 11-50T standard gearing allows for gears low enough to climb any hill you may encounter, even when using throttle only.\n\nWith a 160mm travel DVO Diamond D2 fork and a DVO Topaz T3 air shock delivering 155mm rear frame travel, this is a do it all type of bike you can rely on for rugged and reliable trail duty for years to come. A refined, ultra light weight chassis allows the Trailblazer to come in at a staggeringly low 51 lbs including the battery system for the base 750W version.",
